        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 49.4a" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="572" ed="#liebermann"/>Frequenter<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="g" target="#Hn_49-4a.lnote.oe.g"/> autem in diuinis legibus interrogandum est, ne aliquid<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="37" target="#Hn_49-4a.lnote.oe.37"/> pretermissum forte remaneat quod annecti<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="38" target="#Hn_49-4a.lnote.oe.38"/> conueniat.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">New row (October 2026): Liebermann’s text transcribed from Gesetze I p. 572 (two independent readings of the page images, differences settled against the page)</note>
